{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53452","headline":"谒禹庙 · 崔词","name":"谒禹庙","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"（按：崔词疑即与薛苹同题禹庙十七人之一。\n）惟舜禅功始，惟尧锡命初。\n九州方奠画，万壑遂横疏。\n受籙尝开洞，过门不下车。\n诸侯会玉帛，沧海荐图书。\n玄默将遗世，崇高亦厌居。\n耘田自有鸟，濬泽岂爲鱼。\n家及三王嗣，殷囚百代如。\n灵容肃清宇，衮服闭荒墟。\n枣径愁云暮，松扉撤祭余。\n叨荣陵寝邑，怀古益踌躇。\n（见《会稽掇英总集》卷八）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔词","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53452.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53452","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}